# Perilous Snare exiles Bot2's Sheltered by Ghosts until the Snare leaves the battlefield. Swords to Plowshares then
# exiles Bot2's only creature, and Bot1 crafts Braided Net with the Snare (CR 702.167a), exiling it as a cost: the Aura
# would return (CR 610.3), but there is no creature Bot2 controls for it to enchant, so it stays in exile (CR 303.4g).
# That return was the one the duration gave: Sheltered by Ghosts stays in exile as an ordinary exiled card and is never
# tried again, and the game goes on (it once tried again for ever). The craft resolves into Braided Quipu. On turn 6 Bot2
# casts Doomed Traveler: there is a creature for the Aura now, but its one return is over, so it stays in exile.

